{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/LinearIncrementingEntityIdGenerator","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/linearincrementingentityidgenerator"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinearIncrementingEntityIdGenerator"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This entity id generator creates linearly incrementing entity ids"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unless an entity is marked as unused then the marked id is returned next in a FIFO order"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with an increased generation."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The slot index 0 is reserved and never provided; slots start at generation 0. A slot whose generation reaches "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UInt32.max"},{"type":"text","text":" is retired and never provided again."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Furthermore it respects order of entity ids on initialization, meaning the provided ids on initialization will be provided in order"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"until all are in use. After that the free entities start at the lowest available id increasing linearly skipping already in-use entity ids."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Linear incrementing entity id generator"}],"type":"strong"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS35LinearIncrementingEntityIdGeneratorV","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeEC